OL,3,AMPs to vote on bill to legalise
OL,4,Aassisted dying in England and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FMPs will shortly vote on proposals to
OL,7,Flegalise assisted dying in England and
OL,8,FWales - watch live at the top of the
OL,9,Fpage
OL,11,FLabour MP Claire Hazelgrove says the
OL,12,Fbill would end the "harmful status quo"
OL,13,Fas she recounts her mother "writhing"
OL,14,Fin pain, while one Tory MP warns of
OL,15,F"grisly unintended consequences" if it
OL,16,Fwere to pass
OL,18,FThe bill would allow adults with fewer
OL,19,Fthan six months to live to apply to be
OL,20,Fgiven help to end their own life,
OL,21,Fsubject to certain safeguards - here's
OL,22,Fa quick guide
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
