OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAnthropic blocks possible attempt to
OL,4,Ause AI to make biological weapons
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe warnings have prompted calls to
OL,7,Faction, with US Senator Bernie Sanders
OL,8,Fdemanding a pause on advanced AI
OL,9,Fdevelopment and a ban on artificial
OL,10,Fsuperintelligence.
OL,12,FPresident Donald Trump has so far
OL,13,Frejected such fears, saying on Thursday
OL,14,Fhe was concerned "if we don't win AI,
OL,15,Fwe're going to be put in a very bad
OL,16,Fposition".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
